"Muy bueno el juego, solo que a veces exagera en las hordas y mandan muchos especiales de golpe, pero bueno hay que aceptar el reto e ir mejorando día a día.\nTambién tiene algunos fallos al momento que algunos especiales te golpean, cómo el de quedar colgando o morir por caídas de un pequeño salto, o cuando los explosivos te golpean salir volando hasta el infinito que a veces te sales del mapa xd.\nRecomiendo el juego, al principio no me animaba a jugar, pero ahora ya llevo 250 horas, 200 en steam y 50 en consolas, uno de mis juegos favoritos en este año.\nEdit: después de jugar acto 3 No Hope, digo que T5 está hecho con maldad pura, casi muero de ansiedad al ver el spam de especiales y zombies, logré pasarlo después de 4 horas y 25 intentos.", "timestamp_created": 1691243665, "timestamp_updated": 1691321149, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.60000002384185791", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143391126", "author": {"steamid": "76561199167512099", "personaname": "Perfil", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199167512099/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 58592, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 31, "playtime_at_review": 38700, "last_played": 1787634761, "avatar": "c73c235ab9b2d8f50b5d1f96abf6686159cebc02"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Quiero ser sincero, solo agregué Back 4 Blood a mi lista de juegos en Steam porque Children of the Worm me recordó al juego en línea llamado Battle Nations de la extrañable Z2. No sé si alguien más sintió eso mismo. Imagina un mundo postapocalíptico lleno de zombis, monstruos aterradores y un grupo de héroes no tan comunes. ¿Listos para partirle la cara a la muerte? Bueno, no literalmente, pero sí, porque aquí nos toca sobrevivir juntos y vivir momentos de tensión con nuestros compinches en la batalla contra el horda. Solo por eso para mí Back 4 Blood es el mejor. Muchas gracias, \nTurtle Rock Studios. Muchas gracias, Warner Bros. Games. Son excelentes sus videojuegos, me alegraron el día una vez aunque la primera partida perdí, me sentí en un escenario muy difícil con sustos inesperados y un arsenal de armas que hacen sentir poderoso mientras masacras zombis por doquier. Comentarios: (legendario)", "timestamp_created": 1691158784, "timestamp_updated": 1691158784, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.542483627796173096", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143363901", "author": {"steamid": "76561198104675609", "personaname": "Luxce2", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ejaqueosses/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4704, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3997, "last_played": 1744326620, "avatar": "55177a7e19bf61211090480ecee62b307c973969"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "maravillosa experiencia, si agregaran mods que fueran compatibles con todas las plataformas, seria simplemente perfecto!", "timestamp_created": 1691117452, "timestamp_updated": 1691117452, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143273343", "author": {"steamid": "76561198066545264", "personaname": "Epsilon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SpaceEnjoyer/", "num_games_owned": 426, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 456, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 456, "last_played": 1680780931, "avatar": "378c4a2ae9afdecca88c9eeba778fe389d51755f"}, "language": "spanish", "review": ">No hay workshop\n>Demasiado tryhard, táctico y estratégico para lo que habían prometido\n>Pase de batalla (para qué?? En este tipo de juegos no sirve ese sistema)\n>Anti cheat (al reverendo pedo porque estos juegos se supone sean casuales, si en el Valorant ya rompe las bolas imagínense acá)\n\nEl juego murió por todos estos problemas, L42D supremacy", "timestamp_created": 1690997128, "timestamp_updated": 1690997128, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 80, "votes_funny": 6, "weighted_vote_score": "0.703115642070770264", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143211106", "author": {"steamid": "76561199061700370", "personaname": "javiermartin32", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199061700370/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3367, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 282, "last_played": 1756690037, "avatar": "6f572bc7127b39d016f5c92b14290a2f3a144cc3"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "SI\n", "timestamp_created": 1690906352, "timestamp_updated": 1690906352, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143188214", "author": {"steamid": "76561198139693366", "personaname": "Dexter", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198139693366/", "num_games_owned": 174, "num_reviews": 61, "playtime_forever": 3117, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1014, "last_played": 1722144492, "avatar": "236caf4df5cd405840c6f01ca849e8bd345fb90e"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "My friend whit whom I play Back 4 Blood with told me that if I post a review about B4B and it gets 222 likes and 52 awards, he will buy me a pack of beer and some vodka. So I'll leave this here.", "timestamp_created": 1690872620, "timestamp_updated": 1692421691, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 112, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.817709922790527344", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 18, "count": 2}, {"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 15, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 9, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 14, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 23, "count": 1}]}]}